Pins that a $( ) command substitution embedded inside a double-quoted string, whose inner text itself contains single-quoted regex/awk-program text, is tokenized correctly rather than tripping the outer double-quote or the inner single-quote state -- $( must reset quote-scanning context to normal for its own span (a quote-aware, heredoc-aware paren-matcher), and a read-only awk/grep pipeline inside it must be allowed.
